# --- trained artefacts --------------------------------------------------
# Model bundles are build products: multi-MB binaries that bloat every clone
# and silently go stale against the training code. They are produced by the
# ml/pipeline/ scripts and must be regenerated, not committed. Committing them
# also hid their provenance -- the versions this repo shipped were trained on
# autoresearch's synthetic labels and were being served by
# risk_engine.get_model_b_bundle() as though they were real.
*.pkl
*.joblib
apps/api/app/services/ml_models/
ml/artifacts/*.pkl

# --- local run state ----------------------------------------------------
autoresearch/daemon.log
autoresearch/data/
autoresearch/experiments.jsonl
autoresearch/best_result.json
autoresearch/train.py.best_backup
ml/cache/
data/raw/
scripts/tupul_sim_output.json
.workbuddy-ai/
